{"title":"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Riley is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> years older than Elsa. The sum of their ages is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/5/1051e7d41ec0b8bd688a872be17538413f4ee97b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. How old is Elsa?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/a/71a1d4748903ba883bc5d50d74243d0239b375e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 10 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 11 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 12 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 13 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 1 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can try to use each of the answer choices, starting from the answer choice with the middle number.\n</p><p>If Elsa is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> years old, then Riley would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/3/ff3e046a82099eed93a6508074e7de218041e625.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 + 3 = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> years old since Riley is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> years older than Elsa. The sum of their ages would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/c/3fce1ed82b1ef2f6d3aef667aecccf4edfd9f7ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 + 15 = 27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>This happens to exactly be what we want, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/5/2658a68bf4ca0d7f951e2f9f07f9ed75dc70ef71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Variable.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Variable)\">Solution 2 (Variable)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Variable)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be Elsa's age. Since Riley is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> years older than Elsa, Riley is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/2/2b2e1d87b1d3aefe9596c2581cda95f088aee03a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" /> years old. The sum of their ages is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/5/1051e7d41ec0b8bd688a872be17538413f4ee97b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/9/f59f79795a4c9ca3f39fd6cde0d550c9a6ff834f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + x + 3 = 27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"119\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/8/2382ae8c78d00f187f5fa004c1310823f5f1b452.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 3 = 27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/c/5ecf52ab437add227ea4851f48b47383f6552351.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x = 27 - 3 = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"137\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/c/e0c320c38feef0786c565e03cae61e1d5e1083c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{24}{2} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"147\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 13 (page does not exist)\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gau